=
Classify each Groww review into exactly ONE of the five supplied themes.

Use the theme descriptions and inclusion criteria.
Choose the closest theme. Do not create new themes.
If multiple themes seem relevant, choose the primary issue.
Return only the review ID and assigned theme ID.

Themes:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.themes) }}

Reviews:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.reviews) }}

Return JSON in this format:
{
  "assignments": [
    {"reviewId": "review-id", "theme_id": "T1"}
  ]
}

Return assignments in exactly the same order as the input reviews. Copy each reviewId exactly as provided. Never modify, correct, or generate review IDs.

