=
Classify each Groww review into exactly ONE label:

confused = Customer does not understand what or why they were charged.
complaint_only = Customer understands the charge but thinks it is expensive.
praise = Customer thinks the charges are reasonable.
unrelated = Review is not about Groww app fees.

Do not guess. Choose unrelated if the review does not provide enough fee-related context.

Return only reviewId and label.

Reviews:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.reviews) }}

Return JSON:
{
  "classifications": [
    {"reviewId": "id", "label": "confused"}
  ]
}

